    "s_en": "Cathie Wood\n, chief of Ark Investment Management, likes to trade around earnings season.\nSometimes, Wood adds or sells stocks right after their earnings. Sometimes, she makes moves days ahead of resul",
    "s_zh": "",
    "s_zcn": "",
    "s_ja": "",
